# Free Life UI dictionary. Columns: english<TAB>español<TAB>português (BR). Lines starting with # are comments.
# Matching is case-insensitive; ALL-CAPS screen titles are upper-cased automatically.
# Trailing ":" "!" "?" "." "..." are handled automatically, so "Name" also covers "Name:".
# Rebuild the .js files with: python build_i18n.py
